                                                "sense_id": "5b65a422-8b43-3ebb-b89e-4fc3cf5142ae",
                                                "text": "He performed so-so during the tryouts, and the coach was undecided whether to add him to the team or not."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f83af979-2c24-4640-b8c8-9713758f3f79",
                        "source_entry_id": "c7e71be0-d4a2-3c01-a315-2fb968430e86",
